text = "Dearest Mimi, I sincerely thank you for managing my shop in my absence. Teaching has taken much time from me, so I greatly appreciate this. Here is how you run the shop:

Each day, arriving customers will tell you what they need.

You will find a couple ingredients in the drawer. 

Take these ingredients to the stations and process them. 

Then, mix the processed stuff in the cauldron. Whichever attributes are strongest will determine what type of potion you make."
scroll_active = false

