theme_override_font_sizes/normal_font_size = 28
text = "If you combine multiple ingredients, the strongest two attributes will create a combined potion. 

Mimi, if you can, use the highest quality ingredients. My clientele will pay extra for it.

Oh, and, you will often need to find ingredients in the Mythical Forest. When the Rune Programmers have fixed the portal, you will be able to go there. Inside the forest, there dwells a most wonderful salesman. 

You may spend gold with him to get some of the best ingredients in the land. When you’re done, you can summon yourself back to the shop from anywhere in the forest.

Best of luck, apprentice.
Prof Jedus"
scroll_active = false
